  "content": "\n\n<h2>公告</h2>\n<p>敬請知悉，目前所有版本均存在影響礦石生成的問題，導致實際生成的礦石數量低於預期。開發團隊正積極修復中，將於盡快推出更新。感謝您的耐心與理解。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expandedworld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1011956?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&label=Mod&labelColor=212121&color=FF6D00\" alt=\"CurseForge-模組\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/expanded-world-dp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1011981?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&label=Datapack&labelColor=212121&color=FF6D00\" alt=\"CurseForge-數據包\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fexpanded-world\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/5GQG2cua?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&label=Mod & Datapack&labelColor=212121&color=008000\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/EKyjXRH9xN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/join-discord?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&label=discord&labelColor=212121&color=0d0f24\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fcmd%253d_donations%2526business%253dsocial.sashiro%2540outlook.com%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dDonation%2526no_note%253d0%2526cn%253d%2526currency_code%253dUSD%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Donate-Paypal?style=for-the-badge&logo=paypal&label=Paypal&labelColor=212121&color=00457C\" alt=\"Paypal\"></a></p>\n<h1>Expanded World 模組／數據包</h1>\n<details>\n  <summary>相容性</summary>\n  <p>### 不支援</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Terralith</li>\n  </ul>\n</details>\n<h2>說明</h2>\n<p>Expanded World 是一款 Minecraft 模組與數據包，將世界垂直高度上限從 384 格擴展至 640 格（Y:-128 至 Y:512），並為多種生物群系量身打造專屬洞穴系統。此外，它還整合了自訂的原版風格建築，並強化了遊戲的地形生成與植被機制。</p>\n<h2>安裝方式</h2>\n<h3>數據包安裝</h3>\n<p>安裝數據包遵循標準流程。在安裝或更新前，建議先備份您的世界檔案。</p>\n<h3>模組安裝</h3>\n<p>Expanded World 亦支援作為 Forge、NeoForge 與 Fabric 的模組運行。請參考各載入器提供的具體安裝指南。</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>將世界高度範圍提升至最低 Y:-128 至最高 Y:512</li>\n  <li>為冰原、雪地、沙漠、叢林、沼澤及惡地等多種生物群系引入專屬洞穴系統</li>\n  <li>增加沼澤與白楊林的植被密度，並於森林與泰加林中新增倒伏樹木</li>\n  <li>擴展原版村莊與掠奪者前哨站的生成位置，覆蓋更多樣化的生物群系</li>\n  <li>於惡地、沼澤、深色森林及叢林新增多種村莊變體</li>\n  <li>新增一種全新結構：配備帳篷與營火的小型營地</li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
